"""Potential pieces and descent occurrences of the class-A residue regimes of the line
`(n+d, n, n-1)`, every gap `d >= d0`; every entry is affine in `l` (`n = d l + r`).
Generated by `oracles/python/class_a_descent_table.py --ray d,eps,r --src ROWS --rows-fn F`
from the exact complete seed graphs of one sample ray of each regime; a proof *target*,
evidence only through `psc.class_a_gap_uniform.certify_regime_descent`.
Source note: docs/class-a-gap-uniform-certificate-design-2026-10-23.md.
"""












